#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3300
msgid "Configuring Graph Element Properties"
msgstr "Konfigurera diagramelementens egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3302
msgid ""
"Graphs in <application>Gnumeric</application> can be configured extensively "
"using the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>. In this way, the user can "
"determine the data used in the plots, the names and labels associated with "
"the data, the numerical values of the axes and the stylistic presentation of"
" all the graphical elements."
msgstr ""
"Du kan anpassa diagram i <application>Gnumeric</application> i detalj med "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>. Där väljer du data, anger namn och "
"etiketter, ställer in axelvärden och bestämmer utseendet på alla grafiska "
"element."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3311
msgid ""
"Graphs are configured element by element, first by selecting the element "
"name in the top left area of the second panel of the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface>, shown as area <guimenu>F</guimenu> in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"graphguru-panels\"/>, and, second, by altering the properties in the bottom "
"area of the second panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>, shown as "
"area <guimenu>J</guimenu>. These changes will be applied to the graph only "
"when the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du ställer in diagrammet del för del. Välj först delens namn i det övre "
"vänstra området i den andra panelen i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> "
"(område <guimenu>F</guimenu> i <xref linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>). "
"Ändra sedan egenskaperna i den nedre delen av den andra panelen i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>, område <guimenu>J</guimenu>. "
"Ändringarna tillämpas först när du klickar på <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
